# Raw paid asset packs (use-in-product license only, no redistribution) — never commit the full
# unmodified pack. Only the baked atlas (public/game/atlas.png + atlas.json) ships; regenerate the
# atlas with `npm run assets:pack` after editing src/game/assets/manifest.js.
public/game/cute-fantasy/
public/game/sprout-lands-sprites/
!public/game/atlas.png
!public/game/atlas.json
